OL,3,AKirstie Allsopp airlifted to hospital
OL,4,Aafter fall during birthday celebrations
OL,5,
OL,6,FTV presenter Kirstie Allsopp has
OL,7,Frevealed she was airlifted to hospital
OL,8,Ffor surgery after slipping and injuring
OL,9,Fher leg while walking home from a beach
OL,10,Fin Devon on holiday.
OL,12,FThe Location, Location, Location host,
OL,13,F55, shared a photo on Instagram of her
OL,14,Flying in an ambulance with cuts on her
OL,15,Fface and a breathing tube up her nose.
OL,17,FShe explained in the adjoining caption
OL,18,Fhow she had "slipped on a muddy patch
OL,19,Fon the steep path", while walking back
OL,20,Fwith her family following her birthday
OL,21,Fcelebrations.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,180,160,200,105,0,100
